<title>INDIA: Indian August CPI up 8.9 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Indian August CPI up 8.9 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's annual rate of inflation as measured by the consumer price index (CPI) was 8.9 percent in August, the government said on Monday.</p>
<p>    CONSUMER PRICES	   Aug 96	Aug 95</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change	+8.9	 +10.9</p>
<p>    Index (base 100=1982)     343	   315</p>
<p>Note - Figures are preliminary.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
